{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/7e6a7122284c8add23344b8f3ac53a75.avif?t=1754487023\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/120e0077f7f7ff4844aad6da3f87366b.poster.avif?t=1754487023\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/120e0077f7f7ff4844aad6da3f87366b.webm?t=1754487023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/120e0077f7f7ff4844aad6da3f87366b.mp4?t=1754487023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Claim the right to rule over scattered ruins and lawless lands! But ruling is no simple task, it demands more than swords and wealth. Grow your domain by constructing buildings, producing goods, trading wisely, and ensuring your subjects are fed, protected, and loyal. Every decision shapes the soul of your fief, and the legacy of those who endure within it. Will you forge a haven of prosperity, or a bastion of control?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/abf008f25a05c45639f38fbde0cb7319.avif?t=1754487023\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/017d26c471f0e18a1a9e4d1d9805f890.poster.avif?t=1754487023\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/017d26c471f0e18a1a9e4d1d9805f890.webm?t=1754487023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/017d26c471f0e18a1a9e4d1d9805f890.mp4?t=1754487023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Expand your territory, district by district, by raising central buildings and production sites to meet the rising needs of your population. Each rest marks the passage of time, advancing construction and fulfilling vital needs: food, security, education, and merchandise.<br><br>But happiness is fragile. From bustling markets to training grounds, taverns to farms, every building plays its part. Manage growth with care to keep your people fed, entertained, and protected, or risk discontent\u2026 or worse.  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/7a101c6aac322e7f53749a770839bae5.avif?t=1754487023\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/9bf504dd5c1f9800dfb9a5b29b9cfc0f.poster.avif?t=1754487023\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/9bf504dd5c1f9800dfb9a5b29b9cfc0f.webm?t=1754487023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899740/extras/9bf504dd5c1f9800dfb9a5b29b9cfc0f.mp4?t=1754487023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Power is never neutral. As your fief expands, so does its identity and the voices that seek to influence it. All who serve beneath your banner leave their mark, shifting the needs and nature of your domain. Their presence and dominance will define what your fief becomes, and what it demands of you.<br><br>Forge your path by choosing your ideals. Rule through strength, wisdom, profit or crime. Enact laws, issue mandates, and govern as a tyrant, a merchant prince, or a voice of the people. The buildings you raise, the people you welcome, and the values you uphold all shape your alignment, and 